x759 call close x758 
x760 write x759 2
x761 text "e0 fn clamp u32 u32 u32 -> u32\nlo lt p0 p1\nhi lt p2 p0\na select lo p1 p0\nr select hi p2 a\nret r\n\n"
x762 puts x760 x761
x763 call open x762 6
x764 write x763 4
x765 write x764 2
