x770 puts x768 x769
x771 call close x770 
x772 write x771 2
x773 text "e0\nhi lt p2 a\nr select hi p2 a"
x774 puts x772 x773
x775 call close x774 
x776 call close x775 
x777 call close x776 
x778 call open x777 13
x779 write x778 4
x780 write x779 1
x781 text "diagnostics"
x782 puts x780 x781
x783 call open x782 11
x784 write x783 2
x785 text "Diagnostics"
x786 puts x784 x785
x787 call close x786 
x788 call open x787 2
x789 write x788 2
x790 text "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: a reply that is ambiguous is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x791 puts x789 x790
x792 call close x791 
x793 call close x792 
ret x793
end

